sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User Browser
    participant FE as FireFly Frontend
    participant API as FireFly API
    participant Auth as Better-Auth
    participant IDP as OIDC Provider
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Databricks as Databricks

    rect rgb(239, 246, 255)
        Note over User,IDP: User Authentication (SSO)
        User->>FE: Access FireFly
        FE->>Auth: Check session
        Auth->>DB: Lookup session
        DB-->>Auth: No valid session
        Auth->>IDP: Redirect to login
        User->>IDP: Enter credentials
        IDP-->>FE: Auth callback with tokens
        FE->>Auth: Create session
        Auth->>DB: Store session + tokens
        DB-->>Auth: Session created
    end

    rect rgb(240, 253, 244)
        Note over User,DB: Organization Selection
        User->>FE: Select organization
        FE->>API: POST /api/auth/set-active-organization
        API->>Auth: Update activeOrganizationId
        Auth->>DB: Update session
        DB-->>API: Updated
        API-->>FE: Organization set
    end

    rect rgb(255, 247, 237)
        Note over User,Databricks: API Request with SPN
        User->>FE: Request data (e.g., list catalogs)
        FE->>API: GET /api/databricks/unity-catalog/catalogs
        API->>Auth: Validate session
        Auth->>DB: Get session + org
        DB-->>API: Session + activeOrganizationId
        API->>DB: Get org SPN credentials
        DB-->>API: clientId, clientSecret (encrypted)
        API->>Databricks: POST /oidc/v1/token
        Note right of API: client_credentials grant
        Databricks-->>API: access_token
        API->>Databricks: GET /api/2.1/unity-catalog/catalogs
        Note right of API: Authorization: Bearer {spn_token}
        Databricks-->>API: Catalog list
        API-->>FE: Catalog data
        FE-->>User: Display catalogs
    end
